        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8rs",
          "text": "The sooner you contact us, the quicker we can start building your personal injury claim. Our contingency fee structure means that you only pay when we secure compensation for you. Call today and discover how a client-centered legal practice works for you.",
