      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8rw",
          "text": "Insurance adjusters generally want to settle claims quickly and for the least amount of money possible. This is not because insurance adjusters are bad people; instead, they work for insurance companies whose primary goal is to make money for shareholders. It is against your best interests to make any statements to an insurance company, sign any documents, or accept a settlement without having it reviewed by a personal injury attorney.",
